The '''Gamor Run''' was a trade route that ran from [[Gamor system|Gamor]] on the [[Corellian Run]] to the [[Rorak system]] in [[Hutt Space]]. The [[Trax Tube]] crossed the Gamor Run at [[Daalang]], and another [[hyperspace route]] branched off the Run between Gamor and [[Aridus]].<ref name="Map" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The roleplaying sourcebook ''[[Nexus of Power]]'' incorrectly places [[Iktotch]] on the Gamor Run,<ref name="Nexus">''[[Nexus of Power]]''</ref> despite all other maps placing it a significant distance away from it.

